      "body": "Good morning,\n\nPlease accept this as first notice of loss for Golden Gate Hospitality Group LLC under policy CPP-8830471 with Chubb Group.\n\nIncident summary: a guest bathroom supply line ruptured at one of the properties, causing water damage to the guest room and adjacent corridor flooring. The loss was discovered on 08/12/2025 and mitigation was started immediately. Please advise if you need any additional claim forms, photos, or reserve information.\n\nRequested effective date for claim handling: 08/12/2025.\n\nThank you,\nOlivia Bennett\nGolden Gate Hospitality Group LLC",
